00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,400
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Tag is a very fun game.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,720
George, Lisa, and Laura play tag every day.

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,860
Lisa and Laura run around.

4
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,980
George tries to chase them.

5
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:18,240
He runs as fast as he can.

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,020
He decides to find Lisa.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,020
She is a slow runner.

8
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,200
He sees her running.

9
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,460
He catches up to her.

10
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,920
He taps her on the shoulder.

11
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,880
He says to her, Tag, you're it!
